{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agora Project is a small learning project where you unveil a short story about a girl going to a party.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my FIRST commercial project and is not perfect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I listed the game for the lowest price possible on Steam now that many people made me realize 5 dollar was indeed too much for a short game from a person new to game development. I'm aware of the game's issues </strong>and would have liked to fix them, <strong>but I don't have access to the files anymore </strong>because I sold the PC I made it on and bought a new one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By purchasing this game</strong>, you're supporting and encouraging my progress. <strong>I won't stop making games no matter what</strong>. <strong>I promise I'll make better and better games</strong> until I create very good games, with the right price tag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Thanks for the support. Sincerely, Luis Gutty, the creator</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2988440?t=1770552531","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770552531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770552531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770552531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game has graphic depictions of prostitution, murders, and kidnappings. It is based on a true story and unsuitable for sensitive people."},"detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1770552531\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1770552531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1770552531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agora Project is a small learning project where you unveil a short story about a girl going to a party.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my FIRST commercial project and is not perfect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I listed the game for the lowest price possible on Steam now that many people made me realize 5 dollar was indeed too much for a short game from a person new to game development. I'm aware of the game's issues </strong>and would have liked to fix them, <strong>but I don't have access to the files anymore </strong>because I sold the PC I made it on and bought a new one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By purchasing this game</strong>, you're supporting and encouraging my progress. <strong>I won't stop making games no matter what</strong>. <strong>I promise I'll make better and better games</strong> until I create very good games, with the right price tag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Thanks for the support. Sincerely, Luis Gutty, the creator</strong>.</p>","developers":["Anttarez Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st